#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:5
msgid "Buy"
msgstr "采购"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:7
msgid ""
"**Buy** is what is bought: where each line can be obtained, and a quote per "
"supplier. It is the other half of :doc:`Build vs Buy "
"</digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_bvb>` -- every line whose switch "
"says *buy* is asked about here."
msgstr ""
"**Buy** 讲的是哪些东西是采购的：每一个条目可以从哪里得到，以及每个供应商各给一份报价。它是 :doc:`Build vs Buy "
"</digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_bvb>` 的另一半 -- 开关拨到 *buy* "
"的每一个条目都会在这里被问到。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:13
msgid "In the UI"
msgstr "在界面中"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:15
msgid ""
"A line per thing bought, and under each the suppliers that carry it with "
"what each one quoted. A line nobody carries says so, which is the same "
"finding the ``manufacturability`` check reports from the command line."
msgstr ""
"每一样采购来的东西一行，每一行下面是有货的那些供应商以及各自的报价。没人有货的条目会如实说明，而这与 ``manufacturability`` "
"检查从命令行报告出来的是同一个发现。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:19
msgid ""
"The Manufacturing group's Buy tab: what is bought, from whom, and for how "
"much"
msgstr "Manufacturing 组的 Buy 标签页：采购什么、从谁那里买、多少钱"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:25
msgid "On the command line"
msgstr "在命令行中"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:35
msgid ""
"``find`` and ``quote`` take parts and assemblies alike. An assembly that is "
"sold assembled is ordered as one item, and the walk down stops at every sub-"
"assembly that is; ``-r`` walks all the way to the parts regardless."
msgstr ""
"``find`` 和 ``quote`` "
"对零件和装配体一样接受。整装出售的装配体会作为一个条目来订购，而往下走查的过程会在每一个这样的子装配体处停下；加上 ``-r`` "
"则不管怎样都一直走查到零件为止。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:42
msgid "Providers and suppliers"
msgstr "提供方与供应商"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:44
msgid ""
"PartCAD currently supports two types of providers -- entities that can "
"provide parts and assemblies -- ``store`` and ``manufacturer``. ``store`` "
"quotes and orders parts from existing lists, by ``vendor`` and ``SKU``. "
"``manufacturer`` quotes and orders parts from their 3D model, by making them"
" -- 3D printing them, for instance."
msgstr ""
"PartCAD 目前支持两类提供方 -- 也就是能够提供零件和装配体的实体 -- ``store`` 和 ``manufacturer`` "
"。``store`` 按 ``vendor`` 和 ``SKU`` 从现有清单中询价和订购零件。``manufacturer`` 则按零件的 3D "
"模型来询价和订购，也就是通过把它们制造出来 -- 比如用 3D 打印。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:68
msgid ""
"Assemblies that are sold in an assembled state are declared the same way, "
"using ``vendor`` and ``sku`` on the assembly itself."
msgstr "以组装好的状态出售的装配体也用同样的方式声明：在装配体自身上使用 ``vendor`` 和 ``sku`` 。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:71
msgid ""
"See :ref:`procurement` for more information about declaring purchasable "
"objects, and :ref:`providers` for more information about the providers and "
"how PartCAD selects them."
msgstr ""
"有关声明可采购对象的更多信息，请参见 :ref:`procurement` ；有关提供方以及 PartCAD 如何选择它们的更多信息，请参见 "
":ref:`providers` 。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:75
msgid ""
"In the future, PartCAD will support ``assembler``, which is supposed to "
"produce an assembly given assembly instructions and using parts ordered from"
" ``store``-s and ``manufacturer``-s."
msgstr ""
"未来，PartCAD 将支持 ``assembler`` （装配方），它会根据装配说明、并使用从 ``store`` 和 "
"``manufacturer`` 订购的零件来生产装配体。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:79
msgid ""
"Currently, the provider has to be explicitly specified in the quote or order"
" request, or explicitly specified as one of the suppliers in the package "
"where the parts are declared, or in the package of the assembly they are "
"procured for:"
msgstr ""
"目前，提供方必须在询价或订购请求中显式指定，或者在声明这些零件的那个包中、或者在它们为之采购的那个装配体所在的包中，被显式指定为其中一个供应商："

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:90
msgid ""
"A supplier is written from the point of view of the package that lists it, "
"and is resolved against that package the way every other reference it makes "
"is: a bare name is one of its own providers, while a qualified one lets it "
"buy from a provider defined elsewhere instead of declaring one of its own."
msgstr ""
"供应商是从列出它的那个包的视角书写的，并像该包所做的其他任何引用一样，相对于该包来解析：裸名称指的是它自己的某个提供方，而带限定的名称则让它可以从别处定义的提供方那里采购，而不必自己声明一个。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:95
msgid ""
"A package served by a repository plugin has no ``partcad.yaml`` to write "
"this in, so its plugin states the same section in the package's ``meta``, "
"and it is read the same way (see :ref:`repositories`):"
msgstr ""
"由仓库插件提供的包没有可供书写这些内容的 ``partcad.yaml`` ，因此它的插件会在包的 ``meta`` "
"中给出同样的小节，读取方式也完全相同（参见 :ref:`repositories` ）："

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:103
msgid ""
"A package that builds assemblies out of somebody else's parts can say where "
"to buy them, too. When ``pc supply`` breaks an assembly (or a scene) down "
"into what it is procured from, every one of those parts is looked for first "
"at the suppliers of the package the assembly is declared in, and then at the"
" ones its own package names. So a package of models built from a parts "
"library that knows nothing of a particular store can still be quoted at that"
" store:"
msgstr ""
"一个用别人的零件搭出装配体的包，同样可以说明去哪里买那些零件。当 ``pc supply`` "
"把一个装配体（或一个场景）分解成它所由之采购的东西时，其中每一个零件都会先在声明该装配体的那个包的各个供应商处查找，然后才去它自己所在包所指名的那些供应商处查找。所以一个由某个零件库搭出模型的包，即使那个库对某家特定商店一无所知，也照样能在那家商店得到报价："

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:120
msgid ""
"A part asked for on its own, rather than as part of an assembly, is looked "
"for at its own package's suppliers only, and so is every part ``pc test`` "
"checks."
msgstr ""
"单独被问到的零件 -- 也就是不是作为某个装配体的一部分被问到的 -- 只会在它自己所在包的那些供应商处查找，而 ``pc test`` "
"检查的每一个零件也是如此。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:123
msgid ""
"In the future PartCAD will be able to select providers based on the location"
" and preferences of the requester, while leaving the possibility to enforce "
"the use of a specific provider for corresponding parts (for example, for "
"parts that are using a patented design)."
msgstr ""
"未来，PartCAD 将能够根据请求方的位置和偏好来选择提供方，同时仍保留为相应零件强制使用特定提供方的可能性（例如，对于采用了专利设计的零件）。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:129
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:131
msgid ""
"`examples/provider_store "
"<https://github.com/partcad/partcad/tree/main/examples/provider_store>`_ "
"declares a ``store`` provider and parts bought from it; "
"`examples/provider_manufacturer "
"<https://github.com/partcad/partcad/tree/main/examples/provider_manufacturer>`_"
" declares a ``manufacturer`` and parts it makes from their models."
msgstr ""
"`examples/provider_store "
"<https://github.com/partcad/partcad/tree/main/examples/provider_store>`_ "
"声明了一个 ``store`` 提供方以及从它那里买来的零件；而 `examples/provider_manufacturer "
"<https://github.com/partcad/partcad/tree/main/examples/provider_manufacturer>`_"
" 声明了一个 ``manufacturer`` 以及它根据模型制造出来的那些零件。"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:137
msgid "Agent skills"
msgstr "智能体技能"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:139
msgid "``/pc:validate``"
msgstr "``/pc:validate``"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/manufacturing_buy.rst:140
msgid ""
"Reads the bill of materials, which is what is procured, as part of giving a "
"requirement its verdict."
msgstr "在给某项需求下结论的过程中读取物料清单，也就是实际被采购的那些东西。"
